 "proposedForLevel4Plus": [
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_spyglass_at_dragon",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement (look at the ender dragon through a spyglass) needs the End, which is out of reach at level 3. Rebuilt as a spyglass on a mountain peak. The real dragon trail belongs to level 4 or above, after the stronghold."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_adventuring_time",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement (visit every biome) is a very long collection task. Rebuilt as the start of a journey with a map, a desert and a jungle. A full biome tour belongs to level 5 or 6."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_trim_with_all_exclusive_armor_patterns",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement needs every exclusive smithing template, which only comes from structure loot (ancient city, trial chamber, bastion and others). Rebuilt as copper gear (axe, helmet, pickaxe). A template trail belongs to level 5 or 6."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_craft_decorated_pot_using_only_sherds",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement needs pottery sherds from suspicious sand in ruins. Rebuilt with bricks from clay. A sherd and archaeology trail belongs to level 4 or 5."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_who_needs_rockets",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement (use a firework to fly with an elytra) needs an elytra from an End city. Rebuilt around a firework rocket and a hay landing. The real elytra trail belongs to level 6."
  },
  {
   "id": "adv_adventure_trade_at_world_height",
   "reason": "The vanilla advancement trades at build height (Y 319). Rebuilt with trades above Y 90. A trade at the real world height needs a villager moved to the sky and belongs to level 4 or 5."
  },
  {
   "id": "weltreise",
   "reason": "The old trail visited the End. Rebuilt as an overworld tour (savanna, forest, mountains, ocean, swamp). An End island trail belongs to level 4 or above."
  }
 ],
 "generatorWeaknesses": [
  "REACH_HEIGHT and SWIM print digits (높이 100블록, 20블록 수영하세요) and the hint says 산 위로 올라가요 for every height of 100 or more (in the Nether 언덕 위로), so the brief's 높이 + Sino-Korean numbers (높이 백) cannot be met. SWIM with an ocean condition reads 바다의 물에서 20블록 수영하세요.",
  "Directions (북쪽/남쪽/동쪽/서쪽) have no goal: nothing checks a heading, so (으)로 for a direction appears only in authored finale lines (북쪽으로 갈 거예요).",
  "WaveQaTest.generatedHintsNameTheTaughtWord requires the first taught word to appear in the generated hint, and the Tiers rule prints the official name. Boots (부츠, 장화), leggings (레깅스) and the chestplate (흉갑) cannot be taught with their general word (신발, 바지, 갑옷), so a copper or leather boots step needs a new concept. A new concept in turn needs a lexicon tag, a pronunciation row and German/English glosses, and spyglass must stay without a concept (IconReferentTest), so spyglass steps teach 보다.",
  "variety.distinctTypes.3 counts the goal types of the whole level. Rebuilding the End trail removed the only level-3 REACH_DIMENSION step and the ratchet fell from 28 to 27. The batch had to add a SWIM step to keep 28; a batch should not be able to fail a ratchet by deleting a rarely used type.",
  "The (verb, object) pair cap leaves no room for the explorer's pillars and towers: STACK is at 3 for stone, dirt, stone bricks, sandstone, planks and bricks, BUY bread at 3 and GO the_nether and GO beach at 3. Pillars had to be sand, oak logs and hay.",
  "AVOID takes no entity action and its signature leaves out `during`, so AVOID BREAK_BLOCK hay_block, gold_block, torch and others are taken by their first user whatever the condition. Each AVOID in the batch needed a block nobody had used.",
  "A word that covers a family prints the family: white wool is printed as 양털 in the clue and the finale, and the pyramid or wall of 양털 is checked for white wool only.",
  "A TRADE step has no way to fix where the villager stands, so a trade above Y 90 requires the player to carry a villager up (boat, minecart or ladder shaft) with no hint in the sentence.",
  "A HEAR step on a note block (소리 블록의 소리를 들으세요) was already taken as a signature and a (verb, object) pair, so the music trail uses a flower beside the note block instead; HEAR has no condition that would make a second one unique."
 ]
}
